        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Genera: Bignonia, Pithecoctenium, North American flowering plant genus, genus sharing a name with a work by Diogenes of Athens\n- People: Diogenes of Athens\n- Places: North America\n- Topics: plant relatedness, plant discovery, name matching\n\nFacts:\n- Bignonia and Pithecoctenium are closely related plant genera.\n- One genus closely related to Bignonia and Pithecoctenium is a genus of flowering plants discovered in North America.\n- A different genus has the same name as one of Diogenes of Athens's works.\n- The genus sharing a name with a work by Diogenes of Athens was not discovered in North America.",
